SUMMARY:Let AI Work for You
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Let AI Work for You: Hand Your First Wee
 kly Job to AI**\n\n[Alan Nehemy](https://www.linkedin.com/in/alannehemy/)\
 , founder of Metamorphosis Worldwide\, shows how to hand a real weekly job
  to AI and let it do the work: a task that runs on a schedule\, uses your 
 own notes and files\, and comes back to you for approval\, instead of you 
 having to remember to ask.\nYou'll see it built live\, then pick one job f
 rom your own week to hand over.\nBest for people who already use AI and wa
 nt it to take work off their plate\, not just answer questions. Bring a la
 ptop with Claude or ChatGPT open.\n\n**What to Bring**\n\n1. A laptop (pre
 ferred) or tablet/smartphone.\n2. An account created on ChatGPT\, Claude\,
  or Gemini.\n3. Optional: A buddy or co-founder! (If you don't have a lapt
 op\, we will pair you up).\n\n**Event Agenda**\n5:30 PM – 6:00 PM: Netwo
 rking\, Drinks & Setup\n6:00 PM – 7:30 PM: presentation\n\n**Special dis
 count on ADN engraved Pirani cups!**\nGet $10 off our 5th anniversary cust
 omized [ADN Pirani cups](https://avldigitalnomads.org/meet-our-brand-new-c
 ustomized-adn-pirani-mugs/)! Available in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, y
 ou can select yours directly at this event.\n\n**General Event Info**\nAI 
 Hacks and Hops is a monthly event tailored for non-technical professionals
 \, entrepreneurs\, marketers\, engineers\, or anyone who wants to explore 
 and discuss how to use AI.\n\nEach gathering will feature presentations\, 
 stimulating group discussions\, and a relaxed atmosphere for enjoying your
  favorite brews while delving into the world of AI. Topics will range from
  AI integration in business processes\, marketing\, content creation\, sof
 tware\, ethical considerations\, human-AI collaboration strategies\, to th
 e latest advancements in AI technology. The informal setting encourages op
 en dialogue\, idea exchange\, and fosters a collaborative spirit.
