SUMMARY:TGIF Lunch Break at Taco Boy
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nJoin us for a TGIF lunch break - Mexican s
 tyle. This time\, we are trying out Taco Boy\, South Asheville\, “A Taqu
 eria for The Soul”. The bar offers an extensive list of hand-crafted mar
 garitas\, cocktails\, wines\, and local craft beers... They run lunch as c
 ounter service AND also offered some complementary appetizers too!\n\nTaco
  Boy is located in Biltmore Park\, Arden.\n\nWe plan to sit inside and enj
 oy conversation and Mexican food - a cocktail if your weekend starts early
 !\n\nHere is the [full menu here](https://tupelohoneycafe.com/south-ashevi
 lle/menu/brunch-menu)\, vegetarian options are available.\nMake sure to lo
 ok for our ADN table sign!\n\nAs this is a capped lunch social\, if you fi
 nd you can't attend after registering please cancel so those on the wait l
 ist may join.\n\nLooking forward to seeing you!
