SUMMARY:Classy Cocktails at Capella on 9
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nClassy Cocktails: Nine Floors Up 🍸✨\n
 \nOkay\, Classy Cocktailers\, we’re taking the word classy rather seriou
 sly this month.\n\nFor October\, we’re heading nine floors above downtow
 n Asheville to Capella on 9\, the gorgeous rooftop bar at the AC Hotel\, f
 or cocktails\, conversation and one seriously good view.\n\nAnd yes\, it i
 s every bit as fabulous as it looks.\n\nWednesday\, October 21\n\n6:30 to 
 8:30 PM\n\nCapella on 9\n\n10 Broadway\, 9th Floor\, Downtown Asheville\n\
 nCapella is one of those places that makes you want to sit down\, order so
 mething pretty in a glass and stay awhile.\n\nThe rooftop overlooks downto
 wn and the Blue Ridge Mountains\, with fire features\, sophisticated loung
 e spaces and that magical Asheville-at-dusk backdrop that should be showin
 g off nicely right around the time we arrive. Inside\, the space is sleek\
 , modern and seriously elevated. Literally and otherwise. 😏\n\nThe cock
 tail menu goes well beyond your basic gin and tonic\, with house-crafted d
 rinks\, barrel-select cocktails and creations like their Smoked Bourbon Ol
 d Fashioned. If cocktails aren’t your thing\, there’s wine\, bubbles\,
  local beer and non-alcoholic options too.\n\nAnd nobody needs to drink di
 nner. Capella also serves tapas and small plates made for sharing\, includ
 ing charcuterie and cheese boards\, patatas bravas\, seafood\, vegetables 
 and more substantial options if you arrive hungry.\n\nThis one feels like 
 the perfect October Classy Cocktails night. Crisp fall air\, rooftop fire\
 , mountain views\, beautiful surroundings\, good drinks and a couple of ho
 urs hanging out with interesting people.\n\nCome dressed however makes you
  feel fabulous. Capella may technically lean casual\, but I’m just sayin
 g... this place can handle a little effort. 😉\n\nGrab a cocktail. Order
  a few tapas. Pull up a chair by the fire.\n\nWe’ll see you nine floors 
 up. 🍸🔥🌆
