SUMMARY:The Stranger Hour: A Non-Networking Experiment
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nConfession time: we love our people. Maybe
  a little too much. At every social\, we see the same happy circles\, and 
 we get it. Your friends are great. But somewhere out there tonight is your
  next great friend\, and you haven't met them yet.\n\nSo here's the challe
 nge.\n\n**The Rules**\n\n1. From 6:00 to 7:30\, you can't talk to anyone y
 ou knew before tonight.\n2. Waves are free. Conversations are not.\n3. Cam
 e with a friend? Split up at 6:00 sharp.\n\n**The Stakes:** If you're caug
 ht chatting with someone you already know\, you both owe a beverage (booze
  optional) to whoever called you out. Yes\, your friends will absolutely b
 e watching you.\n\n**The Reunion:** At 7:30\, find your crew and bring at 
 least one new friend with you.\n\nNew to ADN? Congratulations\, you alread
 y know the rules better than anyone. Everyone here is a stranger to someon
 e tonight.\n\nThe game starts at 6:00 on the dot\, so come on time. Will y
 ou accept the challenge?\n\nMasterbbq\, their resident food vendor will be
  serving great food!
